{"id":2369588,"path":"/@Kasushibori/works/210","body":"こんにちは！\n\nオジロスナギツネのお家でオジロスナギツネと隊長さんが見せ合いっこオナニーをするイラストをお願いします！\n\n共通\n・向かい合っている姿を横から見たややローアングル視点\n・衣装は着用→パンツ脱ぎかけ→全脱ぎ姿を描いていただけたらと思います\n\nオジロスナギツネ\n・パンツは黒(白もあったら嬉しいです)\n・胸は程よい大きさでおみ足はむっちりニーソに食い込むくらい\n・全脱ぎ以外はアームカバーとニーソは着用したままで\n\n隊長\n・大きさは平均サイズ、ちょい太め\n・姿自体はシルエットでも可\n・身長はオジロスナギツネより少し高め\n\n\nご検討いただけましたら幸いです！\n何卒宜しくお願いします","nsfw":true,"preview_url":"https://si.imgix.net/ee15e821/uploads/origins/fa59e3e1-77f9-496d-8665-392f3d220fb4?bg=%23fff\u0026txtfont=bold\u0026txtshad=70\u0026txtclr=BFFFFFFF\u0026txtalign=middle%2Ccenter\u0026txtsize=150\u0026txt=SAMPLE\u0026auto=format\u0026fm=webp\u0026w=800\u0026s=432fa305202a5edece06cfe047f9afa2","og_image_url":"https://si.imgix.net/ee15e821/uploads/origins/fa59e3e1-77f9-496d-8665-392f3d220fb4?bg=%23fff\u0026auto=compress\u0026fit=crop\u0026crop=top\u0026w=1200\u0026h=630\u0026fm=webp\u0026blur=200\u0026s=de0762f70e9c4f1641e7bcab2d865b0a","source_body":null,"translated":false,"article_image_url":null,"tag_list":["ラスト","お願いします","こんにちは","思い","イラス","嬉しい","検討","少し","サイズ","身長","以外","オナニー","視点","ニーソ","シルエット","むっちり","ローアングル","ちょい","脱ぎかけ","太め","アームカバー","お家","おみ足","隊長さん","見せ合い","パンツ脱ぎ","オジロスナギツネ"],"anonymous":false,"genre":"art","extension":"psd","duration":null,"vtt_url":null,"movie":false,"width":2376,"height":3360,"software":"Adobe Photoshop","size":"165368153","thanks":null,"source_thanks":null,"translated_thanks":null,"nc":161,"client":{"id":43854,"creator":false,"nsfw_acceptable":true,"acceptable":false,"name":"高菜ごはん","screen_name":"SH703i","avatar_url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1780540476355125248/rgwKEoBa.jpg","header_url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/188398001/1508199055/1500x500","appeal_receivable":true,"popular_creator_rank":null,"request_master_rank":null,"first_requester_rank":null,"deleted_at":null,"tip_acceptable_by":"all","accept_expiration_days":30,"complete_expiration_days":60,"skills":[],"nc":1},"creator":{"id":812990,"creator":true,"nsfw_accepta